---
description: Use when writing or running backend tests for ZenBlog.Application or ZenBlog.API
---
Test handlers in isolation: mock IRepository<T>/IUnitOfWork/ICurrentUserService/
IJwtTokenGenerator with NSubstitute or Moq, assert on BaseResult.IsSuccess and
BaseResult.Data. Validators get their own tests via validator.TestValidate().
Use an EF Core InMemory or Testcontainers Postgres for repository-level tests,
never the real dev database. Put tests in a new ZenBlog.Application.Tests /
ZenBlog.API.IntegrationTests project mirroring the folder structure being tested.
